{% from "components/panel.njk" import panel %}

<main class="landing">
  {% call panel({
    variant: "page",
    title: "Credits",
    subtitle: "Attribution and privacy",
    labelledBy: "credits-title",
    tabs: nav,
    currentUrl: page.url
  }) %}
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="section-lead">
        Everything borrowed to build this site, and what the site does with
        your data. Short version on the second one: almost nothing.
      </p>

      <h2>Privacy</h2>

      <p>
        This site has no analytics, no tracking pixels, no advertising, and
        sets no cookies. Nothing you do here is recorded or sent anywhere.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you open interactive mode and accept the options screen, your audio
        settings and any progress are saved in your own browser's local
        storage. That data stays on your device, is never transmitted, and can
        be cleared at any time through your browser settings. Declining simply
        means those settings reset each visit.
      </p>

      <p>
        Fonts are currently served by Google Fonts, which means your browser
        makes a request to <code>fonts.gstatic.com</code>. That is the only
        third-party request on the site. Self-hosting is on the list.
      </p>

      <p>
        Standard web server logs - IP address, page requested, timestamp -
        are kept by the host as part of normal operation.
      </p>

      <h2>Fonts</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Cinzel</strong> by Natanael Gama - headings and display
          text. Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, via Google Fonts.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Breathe Fire III</strong> by
          <a href="https://chequered.ink/" rel="noopener">Chequered Ink</a> -
          used only for the Mitchtopia wordmark, converted to vector outlines.
          Free for personal and non-profit use; the font file itself is not
          distributed by this site.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Interface assets</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Fantasy UI borders</strong> by
          <a href="https://kenney.nl/" rel="noopener">Kenney</a> - panel
          frames. Released under CC0.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Interface icons</strong> - home, user, projects, contact,
          and the reserved hobby icons are drawn for this site.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Brand marks</strong> - the GitHub, LinkedIn, and Instagram
          logos are trademarks of their respective owners, used here only to
          link to my own profiles.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Built with</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.11ty.dev/" rel="noopener">Eleventy</a> - static
          site generator. MIT licensed.
        </li>
        <li>
          No frameworks, no build-time CSS or JS tooling. Everything shipped to
          the browser is hand-written and readable in the
          <a href="{{ site.site_repo }}" rel="noopener">source</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Corrections</h2>

      <p>
        If something here is attributed wrongly, or an asset of yours is used
        without proper credit, please
        <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a> and I will fix or remove it.
      </p>
    </div>
  {% endcall %}
</main>
